From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:13:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] memtrack: isolate exynos memtrack in soong namespace

add a local soong_namespace to memtrack-exynos so devices can include
it without importing the top-level graphics namespace.
---
 base/memtrack-exynos/Android.bp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/base/memtrack-exynos/Android.bp b/base/memtrack-exynos/Android.bp
index 3f791e2..02d272c 100644
--- a/base/memtrack-exynos/Android.bp
+++ b/base/memtrack-exynos/Android.bp
@@ -12,6 +12,8 @@
 // See the License for the specific language governing permissions and
 // limitations under the License.
 
+soong_namespace {}
+
 cc_binary {
     name: "android.hardware.memtrack-service.exynos",
     relative_install_path: "hw",
-- 
